id: pm-k23c4c
title: "GH-1131: macOS Node 24 nightly cannot create the Skills-over-MCP special-file socket fixture"
description: Nightly Validation run 33085691675 failed only on macos-latest / Node 24 because tests/unit/sdk/mcp/skills.spec.ts binds resource.sock beneath a long temporary skill path. macOS rejects that AF_UNIX path with EINVAL before PmMcpSkillRegistry can exercise the intended special-file rejection contract. Preserve the real non-regular-file security negative control using a platform-safe socket path and prove cleanup plus cross-platform nightly behavior.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
