author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "The special-file negative control executes on macOS, Linux, and Windows without exceeding platform socket-path limits; The test still proves Skills-over-MCP rejects a non-regular resource rather than weakening or skipping the security assertion; Socket and temporary resources are cleaned deterministically on success and failure; Focused tests and the Nightly Validation matrix pass"
parent: pm-rs9vry
resolution: completed
expected_result: The real Skills socket-path security test passes on macOS Node 24 without weakening non-regular-file rejection.
actual_result: "The fixture uses a short native temporary root while preserving real socket creation, lstat classification, and cleanup. Explicit Nightly Validation run 33117244185 passed Ubuntu Node 22/24/25, macOS Node 24, and Windows Node 24."
